  "description": "*From [INKR Comics](https://comics.inkr.com/title/561-living-in-the-palace):*    \nWhile visiting Gyeongbokgung palace, Jian is struck by lightning and passes out. When she awakens, to her shock, she finds herself stuck in the distant past of South Korea.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/inside_gug), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/53846267), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1020004921), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/rockin_sr_0013), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/live_in_gung), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3076209), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=vy9c), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230172)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0BMTSJ63R/)",
